:"3"},{"traceId":"ebda36af7dbe3d9a","entity":"SYSTEM","markdownText":"To verify that your OPA CI/CD workflow is functioning correctly, you should test it in three stages: local validation, triggering the CI (via Pull Request), and triggering the CD (via Merge to Main).\n\n### 1. Local Validation\nBefore pushing to GitHub, ensure your policies pass the same checks locally. This saves time and avoids \"failed\" build badges. Run these commands from your project root:\n\n```bash\n# Verify formatting (this will list files that need formatting)\nopa fmt --fail .\n\n# Verify syntax and references\nopa check .\n\n# Run all unit tests\nopa test . -v\n\n# Simulate the bundle build\nopa build . -o bundle.tar.gz\n```\n\n### 2. Test the CI Pipeline (Triggered by Pull Request)\nTo test the `opa-validation` job:\n1.  **Create a new branch**: `git checkout -b test-opa-ci`.\n2.  **Make a change**: Add a new Rego policy or modify an existing test.\n3.  **Intentionally break it (Optional)**: If you want to see the CI fail, introduce a syntax error in a `.rego` file or break a test case.\n4.  **Commit and Push**:\n    ```bash\n    git add .\n    git commit -m \"Testing OPA CI\"\n    git push origin test-opa-ci\n    ```\n5.  **Open a Pull Request**: Go to GitHub and open a PR into `main`.\n6.  **Verify**: Navigate to the **Actions** tab. You should see the **OPA CI/CD** workflow running. The `opa-validation` job should execute, while the `opa-deploy` job should be skipped (because it's not a push to `main`).\n\n### 3. Test the CD Pipeline (Triggered by Push/Merge)\nTo test the `opa-deploy` job:\n1.  **Merge the Pull Request**: If the CI checks passed in the previous step, merge the PR into `main`.\n2.  **Verify**: Navigate back to the **Actions** tab.\n3.  **Check Logs**:\n    *   The `opa-validation` job will run again.\n    *   Because the target is now the `main` branch, the `opa-deploy` job will trigger.\n    *   Click into the `Build Policy Bundle` step to ensure `bundle.tar.gz` was generated successfully.\n\n### 4. Debugging Failures\nIf a step fails:\n*   **Formatting Errors**: Run `opa fmt -w .` locally to fix files and re-push.\n*   **Test Failures**: Check the verbose output in the GitHub Action logs (`Run OPA Tests` step) to see exactly which assertion failed.\n*   **Workflow Syntax**: If the workflow doesn't start, check the file path: `/home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml`.\n\n\u003c!--\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How do I configure GitHub Actions to upload the bundle.tar.gz as a build artifact?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n[PROMPT_SUGGESTION]How can I add a Slack notification to this workflow when the OPA tests fail?[/PROMPT_SUGGESTION]\n--\u003e","agentProcessingDetails":{},"ideContext":{"currentFile":{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.github/workflows/opa-ci.yml","includedReason":"CURRENTLY_OPEN"},"otherFiles":[{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/src/vertex/prompt_optimizer/docs/data_driven_optimize_tuning_guide.md","includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pkg_resources/tests/test_integration_zope_interface.py","includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/avro/test/test_tether_task_runner.py","includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/setuptools/tests/test_build_py.py","includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/gcs-security-assessment/references/phases/discover.md","includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/extensions/vertex/README.md","includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.gemini/skills/google-cloud-storage-basics/references/mcp-usage.md","includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/.codeoss/data/User/globalStorage/googlecloudtools.datacloud/skill_bases/google-cloud-storage-basics/references/mcp-usage.md","includedReason":"RELATED_FILE"},{"path":"/home/mdbaddi/